rsing into two levels:\n* AddressBookParser handles the first word (alias, contact, game)\n* A new AliasCommandParser handles the second word (add, delete)\n\nThis keeps the code clean and makes it easy to add e.g\ngame commands later using the same pattern.\n\nChanges:\n* Add AliasCommandParser to route alias subcommands\n* Add AddAliasCommand and DeleteAliasCommand (execute() is on-hold\n  until Person supports aliases)\n* Fix Alias equals()/hashCode() to be case-insensitive so that\n  duplicate aliases are caught regardless of capitalisation\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":316,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":77,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"0a0d65437afd69e7e512e2790f0620dedf480dda","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Alias commands testing","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":31,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"15402709dab9a0e0360ecedc025557451090e31e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update import path","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"46a1261f89e6b197e0c503cb9a52d4960838832d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix import order for checkstyle test","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":3,"deletions":5}}}]}],"Zixuan224":[{"date":"2026-03-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"4bec16b11cd80772e4de42b0ac75f59e0215c678","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs with Zixuan\u0027s information","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"e73fe0df04f3077a8000756d5521ea37a55e4eac","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix formatting in AboutUs.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"d4fa993bdbeb3ea58a5167223a474d5e2abdd7fb","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #24 from arcane-cs/branch-update-aboutus","messageBody":"Update team member name 